# Database

- Do not run database migration commands (e.g. `drizzle-kit generate`, `drizzle-kit migrate`, `drizzle-kit push`, or any other schema migration/apply scripts). The user runs these locally.
- When changing `backend/src/schema.ts`, update the schema only - do not create, edit, or delete files under `backend/db/migrations/`.
